{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】愛知名古屋亞殘運，港隊在硬地滾球贏得今屆第一面金牌。</p><p>女子個人賽BC4級，港隊包辦決賽席位，紅衫的劉慧茵7比2擊敗張沅，首次在亞殘運奪金。</p><p>梁育榮在男子BC4級、楊曉林在女子BC2級，決賽同樣不敵對手，收穫銀牌。龍子健則在男子BC1級取得第3名。</p><p>港隊這日在硬地滾球合共贏得1金3銀1銅5面獎牌。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:00:09.730706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:22:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T14:18:03.380054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:40.566734+00:00","content_hash":"378f36b848204c609897a512fd291d61a429066606d99f5b36979173d4ac2c5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}